<title>GERMANY: German Anzag pre-tax profits so far ahead.</title>
<headline>German Anzag pre-tax profits so far ahead.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>German drugs wholesaler Andreae-Noris Zahn AG (Anzag) said on Thursday its pre-tax profits in the first four months of its current 1996/97 financial year were &quot;six to seven percent&quot; ahead of last year.</p>
<p>Management board chairman Hermann Franke gave the estimate at a news conference detailing its 1995/96 results.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
